(>> 3.3 Rules for Projecting Multiviews) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
() Tj
T*
(* Alignment Principle: Front and Top views must be vertically aligned along common) Tj
T*
(projector lines. Front and Side views must be horizontally aligned.) Tj
T*
(* Line Precedence: Solid visible outline > Dashed hidden line > Cutting plane line >) Tj
T*
(Center line > Extension/dimension line.) Tj
T*
(* Miter Line Technique: A 45-degree line drawn from the intersection of projection) Tj
T*
(axes allows seamless transfer of depth dimensions between Top and Side views without) Tj
T*
(manual measurement.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
