T*
/F1 9 Tf
() Tj
T*
(* LINETYPE \(LT\): Loads dashed, center, hidden linetypes. LTSCALE controls global) Tj
T*
(scale factor of dash lengths.) Tj
T*
(* MOVE \(M\) & COPY \(CO\): Translates selected objects by base point and displacement) Tj
T*
(vector.) Tj
T*
(* ROTATE \(RO\): Rotates entities about specified base point by given angle or) Tj
T*
(reference angle.) Tj
T*
(* TRIM \(TR\) & EXTEND \(EX\): Trims objects at cutting edges or extends objects to) Tj
T*
(boundary edges.) Tj
T*
(* ERASE \(E\): Removes selected entities from database.) Tj
T*
(* MIRROR \(MI\): Reflects objects across specified mirror line; option to delete source) Tj
T*
(object or retain it.) Tj
T*
(* SCALE \(SC\): Enlarges or reduces objects proportionally by a numerical scale factor) Tj
T*
(about base point.) Tj
T*
(* FILLET \(F\): Connects two non-parallel lines with a smooth tangent arc of specified) Tj
T*
(radius \(R=0 creates sharp corner\).) Tj
T*
(* CHAMFER \(CHA\): Creates beveled edge between two lines defined by distance1 and) Tj
T*
(distance2 or distance and angle.) Tj
T*
(* ARRAY \(AR\): Generates associative repeating patterns: Rectangular Array \(rows,) Tj
T*
(columns, spacing\) or Polar Array \(items, angle to fill, center point\).) Tj
T*
