T*
(perfectly to the right side.) Tj
T*
(* 6. Project Top View: Draw construction lines downward using XLINE -> Vertical ->) Tj
T*
(Snap to front view vertices.) Tj
T*
(* 7. OFFSET -> 25 mm below front view for top view base -> RECTANG 80 mm x 50 mm.) Tj
T*
(* 8. LTSCALE -> Set to 0.5 to ensure dashed hidden lines of the 24 mm hole display) Tj
